<title>USA: Buffalo, N.Y., weighs new airport.</title>
<headline>Buffalo, N.Y., weighs new airport.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buffalo, N.Y., is planning to build a new airport although fewer people have been flying through the current terminal.</p>
<p>Roughly 500,000 fewer passengers have used the airport in the past two years.</p>
<p>Officials say two nearby airports in Cleveland or Toronto might be taking business away.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
